  "_doc": "GOLIVE-2 row 10 (Tim 2026-10-30 Q1): relations a read may take whole without the shared paging helper (lib/readAll.ts), each under a written reason. Every relation NOT listed here is treated as one that can grow past PostgREST's max_rows = 1000, and scripts/check-unpaged-reads.mjs refuses an unpaged set read of it. Adding a relation here is a decision with a reason, reviewed like code; the year-volume seed (db/seeds/chain-walk-year.sql) is the yardstick for 'can grow' (docs/surveys/GOLIVE-2/seed/relation-counts.txt).",
